{"id":"083aeefac65087f4","group":"29","path":"29/29-lem-extension-pebble.md","title":"扩张公理使 k 卵石无法区分结构","display":"lem-extension-pebble — 扩张公理使 k 卵石无法区分结构","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-lem-extension-pebble","aliases":["29-lem-extension-pebble"],"display":"lem-extension-pebble — 扩张公理使 k 卵石无法区分结构","depends_on":["[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","[[29-df-lk]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Lemma 6.39 and its relational generalization, p.108, DjVu scan 123","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-lem-extension-pebble"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-lem-extension-pebble</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-extension-pebble — 扩张公理使 k 卵石无法区分结构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" href=\"?note=8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" title=\"29-df-extension-axioms\">29-df-extension-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Lemma 6.39 and its relational generalization, p.108, DjVu scan 123"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 正文；独立抽取及来源核对见本轮维护报告"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\">\\(\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" href=\"?note=8bcb53a9a5bd9405\" title=\"29-df-extension-axioms\">29-df-extension-axioms</a> 的约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span> 为有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>-结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L^k_\\tau\">\\(L^k_\\tau\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4de7fc2c34b9d839\" href=\"?note=4de7fc2c34b9d839\" title=\"29-df-lk\">29-df-lk</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> 为闭 FO 句子；满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B\\)</span> 是下式定义的元语言关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\land B\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\land B\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Lemma 6.39 及其纯关系推广，印刷页 108，扫描页 123。当前最多有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k-1\">\\(k-1\\)</span> 个不同的保留顶点。若新落点与已有顶点相同，按既有对应作答；否则按所有涉及新顶点的关系原子的真值模式应用相应 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\">\\(\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}\\)</span>。此应答保持相等关系及所有关系原子。归纳可维持任意有限轮卵石游戏；再对有限变量公式作语法归纳，得到本条显式陈述的句子等价性。这里没有把原子的索引图误当作结构之间的部分同构，也不需要依赖不兼容的跨书接口。已核对原书证明与上述推广。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-extension-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-lk]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-extension-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"8bcb53a9a5bd9405","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}$ 取 [[29-df-extension-axioms]] 的约定；$A,B$ 为有限 $\\tau$-结构。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-lk","status":"resolved","id":"4de7fc2c34b9d839","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^k_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-lk]]，$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 为闭 FO 句子；满足关系见 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L^k_\\tau$ 见 [[29-df-lk]]，$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ 为闭 FO 句子；满足关系见 [[29-df-satisfaction]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau,k,\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"L^k_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B","display":false},{"tex":"A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall\\varphi\\in L^k_\\tau\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;(A\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow B\\models\\varphi).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\land B\\models\\Gamma_{\\tau,k}\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ A\\equiv_{L^k_\\tau}B.","display":true},{"tex":"k-1","display":false},{"tex":"\\eta_{\\tau,\\ell}","display":false}],"bytes":1791,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-103","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-extension-axioms]]、[[29-lem-extension-probability]]、[[29-lem-extension-pebble]] — 扩张公理、概率界和有限变量不可区分性"},{"id":"f2b15fc22e8e3f0c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-157","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-extension-pebble]]"},{"id":"bfe1be5f707cc63a","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-lem-extension-pebble|29-lem-extension-pebble]]"}],"outgoing":["8bcb53a9a5bd9405","4de7fc2c34b9d839","3ee556c64b16809b"]}